# OmniSim code owners.
#
# Default owner for everything in the repo. Requested for review automatically
# when a pull request touches a matching path.
#
# NOTE ON THE HANDLE: a CODEOWNERS owner must be a GitHub *user*, or a *team*
# in the form @org/team -- and must have write access to this repository.
# A bare @org handle is NOT a valid owner: GitHub silently drops the whole
# rule, so review requests never fire and the failure is invisible.
# This repo's canonical public home is github.com/omnilink-tech/omnisim, so
# the owner is the @omnilink-tech account.
#
# (The previous value here was `@OmniLink`, which is a real but UNRELATED
# third-party GitHub organization -- it is not the omnilink-tech account that
# owns this project. That rule was silently invalid.)

